# EmoOS T8.8: the screendump the golden's eyes read back; emo-desktop
# A7.2: the first frame's, taken at the screen pass's present; A8.3:
# the counter's last frame, taken at the loop's fourth; A9.2: the
# client era's, the reborn window over the dead owner's background;
# A12.1: the desktop era's — the two-up beat, the trio, and the
# empty dock after the quits; A13: the entered folder
